{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1359824-why-is-a-gizzely-size-7-loyal-servant-called-small","id":1359824,"title":"Why is a Gizzely (size 7) Loyal Servant called small?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-08T18:41:23-08:00","id":1359824,"title":"Why is a Gizzely (size 7) Loyal Servant called small?","content":"According to the contract Loyal Servant, the Loyal Servant can be from size 1-7. 1 is a baby (small), 5 is an adult (not small), 6 is like a Basket Ball Player (not small), 7 is a Grizzely Bear (really freaking big). So why does the text keep assuming your loyal servant is small?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-08T20:03:08-08:00","id":1359833,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1359824-why-is-a-gizzely-size-7-loyal-servant-called-small#post1359824\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">According to the contract Loyal Servant, the Loyal Servant can be from size 1-7. 1 is a baby (small), 5 is an adult (not small), 6 is like a Basket Ball Player (not small), 7 is a Grizzely Bear (really freaking big). So why does the text keep assuming your loyal servant is small?</div> </div> </div> </div>Because it has Power 1 and Resistance 1 and is a pseudo-ephemeral being made of set dressing. Most of the things they're going to be any good at benefit from being the size of a housecat more than being an appreciable fraction of the size of a sports car.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-18T10:12:24-08:00","id":1361757,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1359824-why-is-a-gizzely-size-7-loyal-servant-called-small?p=1359833#post1359833\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because it has Power 1 and Resistance 1 and is a pseudo-ephemeral being made of set dressing. Most of the things they're going to be any good at benefit from being the size of a housecat more than being an appreciable fraction of the size of a sports car.</div> </div> </div> </div> So it's a statement on power not physical size, they are minor beings got it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-19T01:15:18-08:00","id":1361871,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1359824-why-is-a-gizzely-size-7-loyal-servant-called-small?p=1361757#post1361757\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So it's a statement on power not physical size, they are minor beings got it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, a bear-sized creature with those sort of stats is mostly just a roadblock.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When the cat's a Stray, the mice will pray...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25851-thestray7","name":"TheStray7","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25851_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-20T00:11:36-08:00","id":1362065,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheStray7</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1359824-why-is-a-gizzely-size-7-loyal-servant-called-small?p=1361871#post1361871\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Yeah, a bear-sized creature with those sort of stats is mostly just a roadblock.</div> </div> </div> </div> Actually given that it can be any shape and size and make them virtually out of anything, it can have a ton of uses.<br /> <br /> Like you summon it in the shape of a wall or a ladder, or chair or sofa, or a written message or make it reflective and use it like a mirror, and so much more. Will expand this post tomorrow, I need sleep.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 01-20-2020, 12:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-20T09:48:26-08:00","id":1362140,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1359824-why-is-a-gizzely-size-7-loyal-servant-called-small?p=1362065#post1362065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Actually given that it can be any shape and size and make them virtually out of anything, it can have a ton of uses.<br /> <br /> Like you summon it in the shape of a wall or a ladder, or chair or sofa, or a written message or make it reflective and use it like a mirror, and so much more. Will expand this post tomorrow, I need sleep.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> At that point, it's really more Equipment than Servant, isn't it? I mean, I get what you're saying; those are great uses for it. I'm just wondering how annoyed a Hedge spirit might be to just be called forth to be a ladder or chair.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When the cat's a Stray, the mice will pray...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25851-thestray7","name":"TheStray7","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25851_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-20T10:14:10-08:00","id":1362147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheStray7</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1359824-why-is-a-gizzely-size-7-loyal-servant-called-small?p=1362140#post1362140\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> At that point, it's really more Equipment than Servant, isn't it? I mean, I get what you're saying; those are great uses for it. I'm just wondering how annoyed a Hedge spirit might be to just be called forth to be a ladder or chair.</div> </div> </div> </div> Well equipment that can move and do stuff and has limited ability to think.<br /> <br /> Where is really cool is you can combine it with hedgespinning/Dreamweaving to create some really weird stuff, then turn it into a Loyal Servant. <br /> <br /> You can also boost it abit with a mix of certain contracts and 5 dot autumn mantle merit. <br /> <br /> Like you cam share the effects of Wing and Talon contract with it. So a Darkling Autumn Mantle \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 could use Wing and Talon on themselves to gain speed and a poison attack and then next turn grant that speed and attack to his Loyal Servant. <br /> <br /> Plus they are emphereals so they only take bashing damage from regular attacks. They are a good damage soaker at size 7.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 01-20-2020, 01:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}